{'symbol': 'ES', 'date': '2023-01-10 13:34:00', 'title': "EVERSOURCE AGAIN NATIONALLY RECOGNIZED AMONG AMERICA'S “MOST JUST” COMPANIES BY JUST CAPITAL AND CNBC", 'text': "HARTFORD, CONN. & BOSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--WITH THE RELEASE TODAY OF THIS YEAR'S RANKINGS OF AMERICA'S MOST JUST COMPANIES BY JUST CAPITAL AND CNBC, EVERSOURCE ENERGY (NYSE: ES) IS BEING NATIONALLY CELEBRATED AS A LEADER FOR CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY. THE RECOGNITION MARKS EVERSOURCE'S FOURTH CONSECUTIVE APPEARANCE IN THE TOP-100 OF THE ANNUAL LIST, RECOGNIZING THE COMPANY'S CONSISTENT AND UNRELENTING COMMITMENT TO ITS CUSTOMERS, COMMUNITIES, EMPLOYEES, AND THE ENVIRONMENT IN PROVIDING SAFE, RELIABLE ENERGY SERVICE."}